      "source_url": "https://thaqalayn.net/hadith/34/1/384/387",
      "text": [
        "ه عن المعلّى بن محمّد البصريّ فقد رويته عن أبي؛ و محمّد بن الحسن؛ و جعفر بن محمّد بن مسرور- رضي اللّه عنهم- عن الحسين بن محمّد بن عامر، عن المعلّى ابن محمّد البصريّ‌."
      ],
      "translations": {
        "en.bab-ul-qaim-publications": [
          "And whatever is narrated from Al-Mualla ibn Muhammad Al-Baṣri, I have narrated it from my father, and from Muhammad ibn Al-Hasan, and from Jafar ibn Muhammad ibn Masrur - may Allah (swt) be pleased with them - from Al-Husayn ibn Muhammad ibn Amir, from Al-Mualla ibn Muhammad Al-Baṣri."
        ]
      }
